         <p class="oj-doc-ti" id="d1e35-2-1">ANNEX</p>
         <p class="oj-normal">In Annex I to Delegated Regulation (EU) 2017/2055, the row for Denmark is replaced by the following:</p>
         <div>
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="oj-table">
               <col width="13%"/>
               <col width="22%"/>
               <col width="16%"/>
               <col width="29%"/>
               <col width="20%"/>
               <tbody>
                  <tr class="oj-table">
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table">
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">‘<span class="oj-bold">Denmark</span>
                        </p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table">
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Company registration number (CVR number)</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table">
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">8-digit number (e.g. 12345678)</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table">
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">For sole proprietorship: Company registration number (CVR number)</p>
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">For other natural persons than sole proprietorships: Personal registration number (CPR number)</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top" class="oj-table">
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">8 digit number in the format 12345678</p>
                        <p class="oj-tbl-txt">10 digit number in the format 123456-7890’</p>
                     </td>
                  </tr>
               </tbody>
            </table>
